1
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,500
The station closes before midnight.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,900
Then we should leave now.

3
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,500
Did you bring the map?

4
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,500
It is in the blue case.

5
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,500
Keep your voice down.

6
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,500
Someone is outside.

7
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,500
The hallway is empty.

8
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:09,100
Check the second door.

9
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,500
This lock is new.

10
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,400
Use the smaller key.

11
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,500
That was not here yesterday.

12
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,500
Take a picture of it.

13
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:05,000
The signal is gone.

14
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:18,500
We can send it from the roof.

15
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,300
Wait, I heard the elevator.

16
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,500
Hide behind the cabinet.

17
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,500
They passed us.

18
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:16,900
We only have ten minutes.

19
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,500
The stairs are blocked.

20
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,300
There is another route.

21
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:06,000
Follow the red cable.

22
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:23,500
The control room is ahead.

23
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,500
Do not touch the alarm.

24
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,500
I found the main switch.
